    "Name": "Pulsar D",
    "Details": "The D configuration of the Pulsar OmniMech carries on the legacy of the Nova S, with the largest difference being that it replaced the ammunition-based systems with energy-based equivalents. Six Medium Pulse Lasers in the arms and two Micro Pulse Lasers in the side torsos provide accurate firepower, a Laser AMS defends it against missiles without needing ammunition, and a Nova CEWS takes care of electronic warfare while jump jets keep it mobile.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.07</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_nova"
  },
